# SPEED material file of the whole Rialba mesh, materials to be set
# MATE  BLOCKID  DEGREE  RHO  VS  VP  QS  QP
# QP below VP^2/(2 VS^2) * QS, or SPEED's Y_lambda comes out negative
# (DAMPING 2 attenuates lambda); the values are those of rialba_ttb.mate (Yixin, 2026-11-22)
MATE   1   2   2700   1800   3200   180.0   250.0
MATE   2   2   2350    800   1650    80.0   150.0
MATE   3   2   2550   1200   2050   120.0   155.0
MATE   4   2   1950    565   1020     6.5     9.5
MATE   5   2   1950    565   1020     6.5     9.5
# tag 6: bottom and sides, absorbing; tag 7: topography, free surface
ABSO 6
PLOZ 99 -266.384 -61.984 -242.5 -10000
FUNC 99 1 0.1 2
FMAX 3
EXPN 0.0
